#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improving energy estimation of a Fermionic lattice model with SQD"
msgstr "Meningkatkan anggaran tenaga model kekisi Fermionic dengan SQD"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-"
"addons/sqd/02_fermionic_lattice_hamiltonian.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-"
"addons/sqd/02_fermionic_lattice_hamiltonian.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this tutorial we implement a [Qiskit "
"pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) "
"showing how to post-process noisy quantum samples to find an approximation "
"to the ground state of a Fermionic lattice Hamiltonian known as the single-"
"impurity Anderson model. We will follow a sample-based quantum "
"diagonalization approach to process samples taken from a set of ``16``-qubit"
" Krylov basis states over increasing time intervals. These states are "
"realized on the quantum device using Trotterization of the time evolution. "
"In order to account for the effect of quantum noise, the configuration "
"recovery technique is used. Assuming a good initial state and sparsity of "
"the ground state, [this approach is proven to converge "
"efficiently](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.09702).\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam tutorial ini kita melaksanakan sebuah [corak "
"Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) yang "
"menunjukkan cara memproses sampel kuantum yang bising selepas pengukuran "
"untuk mencari penghampiran kepada keadaan dasar Hamiltonian kekisi Fermionic"
" yang dikenali sebagai model Anderson single-impurity. Kita akan mengikuti "
"pendekatan pemepenjuruan (pendiagonalan) kuantum berasaskan sampel untuk "
"memproses sampel yang diambil daripada satu set keadaan basis Krylov "
"``16``-qubit ke atas selang masa yang semakin meningkat. Keadaan-keadaan ini"
" direalisasikan pada peranti kuantum menggunakan Trotterization evolusi "
"masa. Bagi mengambil kira kesan hingar kuantum, teknik pemulihan konfigurasi"
" digunakan. Dengan mengandaikan keadaan awal yang baik dan kejarangan "
"keadaan dasar, [pendekatan ini terbukti menumpu dengan "
"cekap](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.09702).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The pattern can be described in four steps:\n"
msgstr "Corak ini boleh diterangkan dalam empat langkah:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map to quantum problem**\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 1: Petakan kepada masalah kuantum**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate a set of Krylov basis states (i.e., Trotterized time-evolution "
"circuits) over increasing time intervals for estimating the ground state\n"
msgstr ""
"Jana satu set keadaan basis Krylov (iaitu litar evolusi masa Trotterized) ke"
" atas selang masa yang semakin meningkat untuk menganggar keadaan dasar\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize the problem**\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 2: Optimumkan masalah**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the circuits for the backend\n"
msgstr "Transpile litar-litar untuk backend\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute experiments**\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 3: Jalankan eksperimen**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Draw samples from the circuits using the ``Sampler`` primitive\n"
msgstr "Ambil sampel daripada litar menggunakan primitif ``Sampler``\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Post-process results**\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 4: Proses keputusan**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Self-consistent configuration recovery loop\n"
msgstr "Gelung pemulihan konfigurasi kendiri-konsisten\n"

#. type: Bullet: '       - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Post-process the full set of bitstring samples, using prior knowledge of "
"particle number and the average orbital occupancy calculated on the most "
"recent iteration\n"
msgstr ""
"Proses set penuh sampel bitstring selepas pengukuran, menggunakan "
"pengetahuan terdahulu tentang nombor zarah dan purata penghunian orbital "
"yang dikira pada lelaran terbaru\n"

#. type: Bullet: '       - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Probabilistically create batches of subsamples from recovered bitstrings\n"
msgstr ""
"Buat kelompok subsampel secara kebarangkalian daripada bitstring yang "
"dipulihkan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '       - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Project and diagonalize the Fermionic lattice Hamiltonian over each sampled "
"subspace\n"
msgstr ""
"Unjur dan pepenjurukan Hamiltonian kekisi Fermionic ke atas setiap subruang "
"yang disampel\n"

#. type: Bullet: '       - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Save the minimum ground state energy found across all batches and update the"
" avg orbital occupancy\n"
msgstr ""
"Simpan tenaga keadaan dasar minimum yang ditemui merentasi semua kelompok "
"dan kemas kini purata penghunian orbital\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 1: Map problem to a quantum circuit {#step-1-map-problem-to-a-quantum-"
"circuit}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 1: Petakan masalah kepada litar kuantum {#step-1-map-problem-to-a-"
"quantum-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, we will create the one- and two-body Hamiltonians describing the one-"
"dimensional single-impurity Anderson model (SIAM) with ``7`` bath sites "
"(``8`` electrons in ``8`` orbitals). This model is used to describe magnetic"
" impurities embedded in metals.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, kita akan mencipta Hamiltonian satu-jasad dan dua-jasad yang "
"menerangkan model Anderson single-impurity (SIAM) satu dimensi dengan ``7`` "
"tapak mandian (bath) (``8`` elektron dalam ``8`` orbital). Model ini "
"digunakan untuk menerangkan bendasing magnet yang terbenam dalam logam.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then we will create the ``16``-qubit Trotter circuits used to generate the "
"quantum Krylov subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kemudian kita akan mencipta litar Trotter ``16``-qubit yang digunakan untuk "
"menjana subruang Krylov kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, we will generate the quantum Krylov subspace with a set of Trotterized"
" quantum circuits. Here we create helpers for generating the initial "
"(reference) state as well as the time evolution for the one- and two-body "
"parts of the Hamiltonian. For a more detailed description of this model and "
"how the circuits are designed, please refer to [the "
"paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.09702).\n"
msgstr ""
"Seterusnya, kita akan menjana subruang Krylov kuantum dengan satu set litar "
"kuantum Trotterized. Di sini kita mencipta pembantu untuk menjana keadaan "
"awal (rujukan) serta evolusi masa untuk bahagian satu-jasad dan dua-jasad "
"Hamiltonian. Untuk penerangan yang lebih terperinci mengenai model ini dan "
"cara litar direka bentuk, rujuk [kertas "
"kerja](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.09702).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate ``d`` time-evolved states that specify the quantum Krylov subspace."
" Here, we have chosen ``d=8``. The error from sampling Krylov basis states "
"converges with increasing ``d``. Note that the particulars of this problem "
"instance allow for an efficient compilation of the one-body evolution using "
"`OrbitalRotationJW`; however, in general, one could use Qiskit's "
"[PauliEvolutionGate](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate)"
" to implement the Trotterized time evolution of the full Hamiltonian.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jana ``d`` keadaan yang berevolusi mengikut masa yang menentukan subruang "
"Krylov kuantum. Di sini, kita telah memilih ``d=8``. Ralat daripada "
"pensampelan keadaan basis Krylov menumpu dengan peningkatan ``d``. Perlu "
"diambil perhatian bahawa kekhususan contoh masalah ini membolehkan "
"penyusunan yang cekap bagi evolusi satu-jasad menggunakan "
"`OrbitalRotationJW`; namun begitu, secara umum, seseorang boleh menggunakan "
"[PauliEvolutionGate](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate)"
" Qiskit untuk melaksanakan evolusi masa Trotterized bagi Hamiltonian "
"penuh.\n"

